; The one variable: two relays that drive each other's holders, one of them turned 10 degrees. Godot
; pushes the pair on every transform flush without end (remote_transform_3d.cpp:118-126), and draws the
; box where its last notification before the ref:godot harness frame left it (visual_instance_3d.cpp:90-96).
; Every other RemoteTransform golden settles in the first flushes, so none of them shows a regression in it.

